01:47:28 guide answer (bedrock): [Valley Guide] Hold a golden shovel and right-click two corners of your land to claim it. A claim keeps other players from breaking or taking your things, and placing your first chest starts a small claim around it.
[Valley Guide] On a phone or tablet: right-click means press and hold, left-click means tap, and sneak means the crouch button. On a controller: right-click is LT and left-click is RT.
[Tip] The Valley Guide answers questions about the server.
Type /ask and your question, or start a chat message with the word Guide.
Tap OK on the pop-up, or type /tips ok, to hide this tip.
