01:47:28 FORM {"title":"What's New (Oct 24)","content":"Lost & Found, Maker's mark, a better trash bin, and more\n\nNew commands\n/lostfound - Get back your own stuff lost to lava, fire, the void or a despawn in the last 7 days. Also /recover.\n   No typing: tap Lost & Found on the compass.\n/mark off or /mark on - Choose if things you craft get a \"Crafted by\" line with your name. /mark stats off hides the counters.\n   No typing: tap Maker's mark and Gear stats on the compass.\n/tips ok - Hides the last ti
01:47:28 whatsnew 4 (bedrock): {"title":"What's New (Oct 24)","content":"Lost & Found, Maker's mark, a better trash bin, and more\n\nNew commands\n/lostfound - Get back your own stuff lost to lava, fire, the void or a despawn in the last 7 days. Also /recover.\n   No typing: tap Lost & Found on the compass.\n/mark off or /mark on - Choose if things you craft get a \"Crafted by\" line with your name. /mark stats off hides the counters.\n   No typing: tap Maker's mark and Gear stats on the compass.\n/tips ok - Hides the last tip. /tips shows all your tips.\n   No typing: tap OK on the tip pop-up.\n/autosort - Turns chest sorting on or off, just for you. It starts off. Also /sort.\n   No typing: tap Auto-sort my chests on the compass.\n/wandstyle - Pick how your wand controls work, on any device.\n   No typing: tap Wand controls on the compass.\n/whatsnew - Shows this news again any time. Also /news.\n   No typing: tap What's New on the compass.\n\nCommands that got better\n/trash - Put items on the red side and press OK to throw them away. Close it without OK and you get them back. /trash undo still works for 5 minutes.\n   No typing: tap Trash Bin on the compass.\n\nOther changes\n- Lost & Found costs $16,000. Your first one is free if you have less than $10,000. One a day.\n- Maker's mark: gear you craft shows who made it. Weapons count kills, and armor counts hits blocked.\n- Tips: the first few times you use something new, a short tip explains it until you press OK.\n- The compass Spawn button now takes you to the real spawn, the same place as /spawn.\n- Wand controls: everyone can pick a style with /wandstyle. Sneak bars is for phones and consoles.\n- The menu compass now opens when you tap the air, not just a block.\n\nRead it again any time: tap What's New on the compass, or type /whatsnew.","buttons":[{"text":"Close"}],"type":"form"}
